# Assets Directory

This directory is for application assets like icons, images, etc.

## Adding a Window Icon

To add an icon to the application window:

1. Place your icon file here (e.g., `app-icon.ico` or `app-icon.png`)
2. Update `Views/MainWindow.axaml` to reference it:

```xml
<Window ...
        Icon="/Assets/app-icon.ico"
        ...>
```

3. Update the `.csproj` file to include it as an AvaloniaResource:

```xml
<ItemGroup>
    <AvaloniaResource Include="Assets\**" />
</ItemGroup>
```

## Supported Icon Formats

- `.ico` - Windows icon format (recommended for cross-platform)
- `.png` - PNG images (works on all platforms)
- `.bmp` - Bitmap images

## Icon Size Recommendations

- 16x16, 32x32, 48x48, 256x256 (for .ico files with multiple sizes)
- 256x256 or 512x512 (for .png files)
